                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Every effect control reads its value in its parameter's unit, as the app prints it: 32%, 350 ms, 52.0 Hz, 1.5 kHz, -21.0 dB, 4.0:1, 0.40, 4.32 s. The \"Source 0.xx\" readouts and the \"Scale unverified\" note under each control are gone (#1731, PR #1738); the value sits at the right of the label row, and the controls close up to the app's spacing (label row, 14 px, slider, 14 px to the next)."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
