                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "A stepped parameter with named positions is a choice, not a slider (#1730, PR #1734): a select showing the position's name (Delay Time 1\/16, Mode DIGI GRV, Pumper Rate 1\/16, Slicer Pattern AABB, Amp Cabinet 4x10\", Reverb ER LARGE STUDIO), or two buttons when both names fit (Octaver High mode Off | On). A name longer than the select scales down rather than overflowing."
              }
            ],
