                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Labels are the app's parameter names (Threshold, not Comp Thresh), in the rack variant's order, and a rack pedal is titled by its catalogue module (#1751): the Ballad's EQ is the Four-band EQ, the Funk Wah's filter the Low-pass filter. The single-effect page shows the built-in Delay's three controls."
